		{
			dependencies: ["4FA0AF313BCCF95C"]
			description: [
				"The &aOverworld&r is where every great adventure begins."
				""
				"From rolling plains and towering mountain ranges to dense forests, sprawling oceans, and mysterious cave systems, this familiar world holds everything you'll need to begin your journey. Beneath its surface lie the resources that will power your first machines, while ancient ruins and forgotten structures reward those willing to explore beyond the beaten path."
				""
				"Every expedition reveals new opportunities."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Your first days in the Overworld are all about laying the foundation for what is to come."
				""
				"Gather resources, establish a safe home, and begin constructing the machinery that will eventually grow into a sprawling industrial complex. Explore the many custom biomes and structures scattered across the landscape, collect valuable materials, and prepare yourself for the challenges that await beyond this world."
				""
				"Every factory begins with a single machine."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Although your journey will eventually take you across the solar system and beyond, the Overworld will always remain the heart of your operation."
				""
				"Here you'll expand your automation networks, process resources gathered from distant planets, and continue developing the infrastructure needed to support your ever-growing factory. No matter how far you travel, you'll always return home to build something even greater."
				""
				"The stars may be your destination..."
				""
				"But the Overworld will always be your foundation."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/overworld_screenshot.png width:192 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about the Overworld in its"
				"{ \"text\": \"dedicated quest.\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"5DA842A1588FB8BE\" } }"
			]
			icon: "minecraft:grass_block"
