		{
			dependencies: ["391748CCFCB25D1A"]
			description: [
				"The &cNether&r is no longer simply a place to gather Blaze Rods and Netherite."
				""
				"Beyond the portal lies a hostile world of volcanic landscapes, ancient fortresses, and forgotten civilizations where every biome presents new dangers and valuable opportunities. From rivers of lava to towering basalt formations, survival requires careful preparation and a willingness to explore the unknown."
				""
				"The deeper you venture, the greater the rewards become."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lA World of Fire and Ash&r"
				""
				"The Nether is home to a diverse collection of biomes, each offering unique resources, environmental hazards, and exploration opportunities."
				""
				"Journey through the crimson growth of the &cCrimson Forest&r, brave the unstable terrain of the &8Basalt Deltas&r, and cross the haunting &7Soul Sand Valley&r, alongside several new sub-biomes introduced through &cNether Remastered&r. Every region contains rare materials and hidden secrets that support your continued progression."
				""
				"No two expeditions are ever the same."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lForgotten Strongholds&r"
				""
				"Scattered throughout the Nether are ancient &6Nether Fortresses&r and imposing &8Bastion Remnants&r, each guarding valuable treasures and dangerous enemies."
				""
				"These structures have become essential destinations for every explorer, offering powerful loot, rare crafting materials, and resources required for both Create automation and future dimensional progression. Enter them well-equipped, for every corridor may conceal powerful foes determined to defend their domain."
				""
				"Great rewards are rarely left unguarded."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lForging the Future&r"
				""
				"The resources gathered throughout the Nether will fuel the next stage of your adventure."
				""
				"Powerful alloys, advanced Create components, rare materials, and progression items found within this fiery dimension lay the groundwork for everything that follows—from conquering &5The End&r to reaching the distant worlds beyond the solar system."
				""
				"Master the flames."
				""
				"Claim the riches hidden within."
				""
				"Then prepare for the challenges still waiting beyond the horizon."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/nether_screenshot.png width:192 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about the Nether in its"
				"{ \"text\": \"dedicated quest.\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"3F3994EDD215FC99\" } }"
			]
			icon: "minecraft:netherrack"
			id: "0B3F87B20695A777"
			rewards: [
				{
