		{
			dependencies: ["09EEADB48E883801"]
			description: [
				"The &5End&r is no longer the final destination of your adventure."
				""
				"In &6Create - Forge Frontier&r, this mysterious dimension has been transformed into a sprawling endgame world filled with dangerous structures, powerful bosses, and valuable resources that prepare you for the greatest challenges still to come. Vast floating islands, towering landscapes, and forgotten civilizations await those courageous enough to step beyond the portal."
				""
				"What was once the end of Minecraft has become the beginning of a new frontier."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lThe Dragon's Last Stand&r"
				""
				"At the heart of the End awaits the legendary &5Ender Dragon&r."
				""
				"This climactic encounter has been enhanced to create a more engaging and demanding battle, requiring careful preparation, powerful equipment, and a well-developed factory capable of supplying everything you'll need to survive. Defeating the Dragon is no longer simply about earning credits—it marks the completion of one chapter and the beginning of another."
				""
				"Only those who conquer the Dragon may continue their journey."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lBeyond the Main Island&r"
				""
				"With the Dragon defeated, the true exploration of the End begins."
				""
				"Journey across the Outer End Islands to uncover forgotten structures, powerful enemies, and rare resources unavailable anywhere else in the pack. Hidden among these distant islands are valuable crafting materials, unique treasures, and challenging encounters that support both late-game automation and future dimensional progression."
				""
				"Some of the greatest discoveries lie far beyond the Dragon's arena."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lThe Journey Continues&r"
				""
				"Although you have conquered Minecraft's final dimension, your adventure is far from over."
				""
				"The resources gathered throughout the End will prepare you for the extraordinary worlds that await beyond the Ad Astra solar system. Powerful bosses, advanced crafting chains, and six distant planets inspired by &bAlex's Caves&r still remain before the legendary &6Forge Rocket&r can finally be completed."
				""
				"The End is no longer your destination."
				""
				"It is the gateway to your greatest adventures yet."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/end_screenshot.png width:192 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about the End in its"
				"{ \"text\": \"dedicated quest.\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"7964AB0D39902EFA\" } }"
			]
			icon: "minecraft:end_stone"
