		{
			dependencies: ["0428643E0C764D8B"]
			description: [
				"The &5Otherside&r is a realm forgotten by time, hidden beyond the ancient portal buried deep within the &8Ancient Cities&r."
				""
				"Unlocked only after defeating the fearsome &0Warden&r and awakening the dormant gateway with its &eWarden's Heart&r, this mysterious dimension marks the beginning of an entirely new chapter in your adventure. Strange landscapes, glowing vegetation, and ancient ruins stretch across the horizon, offering discoveries unlike anything found in the Overworld."
				""
				"Beyond the portal lies a world waiting to be explored."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lA World Unlike Any Other&r"
				""
				"The Otherside is home to towering bioluminescent forests, mysterious terrain, and dangerous creatures that have adapted to life within the perpetual darkness."
				""
				"As you venture across this forgotten realm, you'll discover valuable resources, powerful equipment, and unique materials unavailable anywhere else. Among the most sought-after treasures are &eOtherside Ingots&r and other rare crafting components required for advanced technologies and late-game progression."
				""
				"Every expedition uncovers another piece of this world's forgotten history."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lAncient Secrets Await&r"
				""
				"Scattered throughout the Otherside are massive &5Ancient Temples&r and other mysterious structures guarding powerful loot, rare artifacts, and dangerous enemies."
				""
				"These forgotten ruins reward explorers willing to brave their challenges with materials essential for future progression, including components used in advanced Create automation, powerful equipment, and the construction of the &5Forge Rocket&r."
				""
				"Some of the greatest treasures in the pack lie hidden within these ancient halls."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The Otherside is more than another dimension."
				""
				"It is a bridge between the familiar worlds you've conquered and the extraordinary adventures still waiting beyond the stars."
				""
				"Explore its forgotten ruins."
				""
				"Master its powerful resources."
				""
				"And prepare for the challenges that lie beyond."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/otherside_screenshot.png width:192 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about Deeper Darker in its"
				"{ \"text\": \"dedicated quest.\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"638EF7DB16108237\" } }"
			]
