		{
			dependencies: ["3A09B8EFE2811CB9"]
			description: [
				"The worlds of &6Ad Astra&r represent humanity's first great leap beyond the Overworld."
				""
				"Each planet offers its own unique environment, valuable resources, dangerous structures, and powerful challenges that will test everything you've learned throughout your journey. From the silent craters of the Moon to the frozen plains of Glacio, every expedition expands both your technological capabilities and your understanding of the cosmos."
				""
				"The farther you travel from home, the more extraordinary the discoveries become."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lExploring New Worlds&r"
				""
				"Every planet presents a completely different experience."
				""
				"Establish off-world outposts, adapt to unfamiliar environments, gather extraterrestrial resources, and uncover ancient structures hidden across the solar system. Along the way, you'll encounter powerful bosses, rare materials, and unique progression opportunities that cannot be found anywhere else."
				""
				"No two planets are alike, and each one offers new lessons for the engineer willing to explore them."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lExpanding Humanity's Reach&r"
				""
				"With every successful mission, your factory grows stronger."
				""
				"The resources gathered across the Ad Astra planets unlock new technologies, advanced Create automation, and increasingly powerful rockets capable of reaching even more distant worlds. Every launch builds upon the last, gradually transforming your modest workshop into a thriving interplanetary industrial complex."
				""
				"Each planet conquered is another step toward mastering the stars."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The worlds of &6Ad Astra&r are only the beginning."
				""
				"Beyond Glacio and even &5The End&r lie entirely new frontiers waiting to be explored. The knowledge, resources, and experience gained throughout your journey across the solar system will prepare you for the extraordinary planets that await later in your adventure."
				""
				"The solar system is vast..."
				""
				"But it is only the first chapter of your journey through the cosmos."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/moon_screenshot.png width:192 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about Ad Astra in its"
				"{ \"text\": \"dedicated quest.\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"1523A7C10CEF69AA\" } }"
			]
