		{
			dependencies: ["58AF77D0696B9822"]
			description: [
				"The &bAlex's Caves Planets&r represent the greatest leap into the unknown throughout your entire adventure."
				""
				"Unlocked after constructing the &dTier 5 Rocket&r, these extraordinary worlds exist beyond the familiar boundaries of the Ad Astra solar system. Each planet is inspired by one of the remarkable biomes from &bAlex's Caves&r, transforming underground ecosystems into fully explorable alien worlds filled with unique mechanics, dangerous creatures, powerful bosses, and invaluable resources."
				""
				"No two planets are alike."
				""
				"Each one tells its own story."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lWorlds Beyond Imagination&r"
				""
				"Your journey begins with the first three Alex's Caves planets:"
				""
				"- &1Abyssal Chasm&r — A world consumed by endless oceans, ancient civilizations, and colossal sea monsters lurking within the abyss."
				""
				"- &2Primordial Caves&r — A prehistoric wilderness where dinosaurs roam beneath towering volcanoes and forgotten cave paintings preserve the history of an ancient civilization."
				""
				"- &8Forlorn Hollows&r — A realm of darkness inhabited by corrupted creatures, mysterious rituals, and forgotten civilizations hidden beneath layers of Guanostone."
				""
				"Each planet introduces entirely new mechanics that fundamentally change how you explore and survive."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"As your journey continues, even stranger worlds await discovery."
				""
				"- &9Magnetic Caves&r challenge explorers with powerful magnetic forces, rare minerals, and technology unlike anything found elsewhere."
				""
				"- &2Toxic Caves&r plunge you into a radioactive wasteland filled with hazardous chemicals, dangerous mutations, and scientific experiments gone terribly wrong."
				""
				"- &dCandy Cavity&r offers a deceptively cheerful landscape of sweets, colorful villages, bizarre creatures, and hidden dangers lurking beneath its sugary surface."
				""
				"Every planet presents new resources, unique progression systems, and unforgettable encounters that continue expanding your adventure."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lThe Ultimate Frontier&r"
				""
				"The Alex's Caves planets represent the pinnacle of exploration within &6Create - Forge Frontier&r."
				""
				"Each world introduces exclusive materials, advanced crafting components, legendary boss encounters, and specialized mechanics required to construct the final tiers of rocket technology and ultimately complete the legendary &6Forge Rocket&r."
				""
				"Master these extraordinary worlds, uncover their secrets, and prove your ability to thrive where no explorer has gone before."
				""
				"The solar system prepared you for this moment."
				""
				"Now it's time to conquer the unknown."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/alexscaves_screenshot.png width:192 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about Alex's Caves in its"
				"{ \"text\": \"dedicated quest.\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"308B363D1029D44E\" } }"
			]
			icon: "alexscaves:spelunkery_table"
			id: "2E5C57802F26496D"
			rewards: [
