		{
			dependencies: ["0B3F87B20695A777"]
			description: [
				"The &6Tier 1 Rocket&r marks the beginning of humanity's journey beyond the Overworld."
				""
				"Everything you've built so far—your factory, your automation systems, and your engineering expertise—has been leading to this moment. With your first rocket complete, you'll finally leave your home planet behind and begin exploring the vast frontier of space through &6Ad Astra&r."
				""
				"The stars are no longer beyond your reach."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lYour First Mission&r"
				""
				"The &6Tier 1 Rocket&r grants access to the first worlds beyond Earth: the &7Moon&r and &cMars&r."
				""
				"These distant planets introduce entirely new environments filled with valuable resources, dangerous structures, powerful bosses, and unique progression opportunities unavailable anywhere in the Overworld. Every expedition expands your technological capabilities and provides the materials needed to construct even more advanced spacecraft."
				""
				"Every launch is another step toward the unknown."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lBuilding a Space Program&r"
				""
				"Constructing your first rocket is far more than simply crafting another machine."
				""
				"It represents the birth of your space program—a milestone that transforms your factory from an industrial operation into an interplanetary engineering complex. The resources you gather from the Moon and Mars will fuel new automation systems, unlock powerful technologies, and lay the foundation for every rocket that follows."
				""
				"The journey to the stars begins with a single launch."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/tier_1.png width:130 height:190 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about the Tier 1 Rocket in its"
				"{ \"text\": \"dedicated quest.\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"79B13E9FA5446394\" } }"
			]
