		{
			dependencies: ["43160A0A3268A07D"]
			description: [
				"The &8Deep Dark&r is unlike any place you've explored before."
				""
				"Hidden far beneath the Overworld lies an ancient civilization swallowed by darkness, its once-great cities now consumed by Sculk and haunted by one of the most terrifying creatures in Minecraft. Every step through these silent ruins carries risk, where even the smallest sound can awaken something far more dangerous than the darkness itself."
				""
				"Some places are meant to remain undisturbed."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lInto the Ancient Cities&r"
				""
				"Scattered throughout the Deep Dark are the massive &8Ancient Cities&r, abandoned settlements filled with valuable loot, rare resources, and mysterious technology unlike anything found elsewhere in the Overworld."
				""
				"As you search their forgotten halls, you'll uncover powerful equipment, unique crafting materials, and clues surrounding the dormant portal standing at the center of each city. Every treasure you recover brings you one step closer to unlocking an entirely new dimension."
				""
				"Explore carefully..."
				""
				"The city is always listening."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lAwakening the Otherside&r"
				""
				"Deep within every Ancient City waits the fearsome &0Warden&r, a creature unlike any other you've encountered."
				""
				"Blind yet incredibly sensitive to sound and vibration, the Warden can quickly overwhelm even well-equipped adventurers. Defeating this formidable guardian rewards the &eWarden's Heart&r, the ancient relic required to awaken the mysterious portal found within the city."
				""
				"Once activated, the gateway grants access to the &5Otherside&r, opening the path toward new resources, powerful technologies, and the next stage of your adventure."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The Deep Dark is more than a dangerous biome."
				""
				"It is the gateway to an entirely new world."
				""
				"Master its silence, conquer its guardian, and uncover the mysteries hidden beyond the ancient portal."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/deepdark_screenshot.png width:192 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about Deeper Darker in its"
