		{
			dependencies: ["090A156A3CB027A3"]
			description: [
				"The journey to &5The End&r has been completely reimagined."
				""
				"In &6Create - Forge Frontier&r, reaching Minecraft's final dimension is no longer a matter of crafting a handful of Eyes of Ender and locating the nearest Stronghold. Instead, your adventure unfolds across every stage of progression, challenging you to explore distant worlds, conquer powerful bosses, and uncover ancient relics hidden throughout the pack."
				""
				"The End is no longer simply a destination."
				""
				"It is a reward earned through your entire journey."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lFifteen Eyes, Fifteen Adventures&r"
				""
				"To awaken the End Portal, you must obtain &e15 unique Ender Eyes&r, each representing a different challenge, dimension, or milestone throughout your adventure."
				""
				"Every Eye requires its own journey to obtain. Some demand exploration of forgotten structures, others require defeating formidable bosses, while many are crafted using rare resources gathered from across the Overworld, Nether, Ad Astra planets, and beyond."
				""
				"Every Eye collected is another step toward your ultimate goal."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lThe Final Gateway&r"
				""
				"Once all fifteen Eyes have been assembled, the ancient Stronghold finally reveals its true purpose."
				""
				"Place each Eye into the End Portal Frame and watch as the gateway slowly awakens, bringing together every challenge you've overcome throughout your adventure. Unlike vanilla Minecraft, activating the portal now serves as the culmination of dozens of hours of exploration, automation, and progression."
				""
				"Only those who have truly mastered the world around them will stand before the portal."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lBeyond the Dragon&r"
				""
				"Defeating the &5Ender Dragon&r is not the end of your adventure."
				""
				"The End serves as the gateway to an entirely new chapter of &6Create - Forge Frontier&r. Beyond the Dragon await powerful bosses, advanced technologies, and six extraordinary planets inspired by the biomes of &bAlex's Caves&r, each offering new mechanics, dangerous environments, and resources required to construct the legendary &6Forge Rocket&r."
				""
				"The End is not your final destination."
				""
				"It is the beginning of your greatest adventure yet."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/endframe_screenshot.png width:192 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about End Remastered in its"
				"{ \"text\": \"dedicated quest.\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"55E1F170D9933E8F\" } }"
			]
			icon: "minecraft:end_portal_frame"
			id: "09EEADB48E883801"
			rewards: [{
				id: "38BE604092AB7681"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 100
			}]
			subtitle: "Conquer the reimagined journey to the End and progress through its unique challenges. Click for more info!"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7239EA06CCC9AF48"
				item: "minecraft:ender_pearl"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&6Eyes of Destiny&r"
			x: 1.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["58F4190183C467EE"]
			description: [
				"The &dTier 5 Rocket&r marks the beginning of an entirely new era of exploration."
				""
				"Built using advanced materials gathered from both &5The End&r and &bGlacio&r, this remarkable spacecraft represents far more than another technological upgrade. It is the gateway beyond the familiar worlds of &6Ad Astra&r, carrying you to distant planets unlike anything encountered throughout the rest of your journey."
				""
				"The known solar system is finally behind you."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lBeyond the Known Frontier&r"
				""
				"With the &dTier 5 Rocket&r complete, you'll unlock access to the first three planets inspired by &bAlex's Caves&r:"
				""
				"- &1Abyssal Chasm&r"
				"- &2Primordial Caves&r"
				"- &8Forlorn Hollows&r"
				""
				"Each world introduces entirely new mechanics, dangerous creatures, powerful bosses, unique resources, and progression systems unlike anything found within the Overworld or Ad Astra. Every expedition presents new opportunities—and new challenges—to overcome."
				""
				"The adventure has only just begun."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lEngineering the Impossible&r"
				""
				"Constructing the Tier 5 Rocket demonstrates your mastery of everything you've learned so far."
				""
				"By this stage, your factory should be capable of sustaining complex automation networks, advanced manufacturing systems, and large-scale resource production across multiple dimensions. Every machine you've built and every world you've explored has contributed toward making this spacecraft a reality."
				""
				"Great engineering creates great opportunities."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The &dTier 5 Rocket&r is more than transportation."
				""
				"It is your invitation to explore worlds untouched by humanity, uncover forgotten civilizations, battle extraordinary creatures, and gather the rare resources needed to construct even more powerful rockets."
				""
				"Beyond these planets await challenges greater than anything you've faced before."
				""
				"The stars were never the limit."
				""
				"They were only the beginning."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/tier_5.png width:130 height:190 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about the Tier 5 Rocket in its"
				"{ \"text\": \"dedicated quest.\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"699FEE9775A89BE5\" } }"
			]
