		{
			dependencies: ["2E5C57802F26496D"]
			description: [
				"The &6Forge Rocket&r is the culmination of everything you've accomplished throughout &6Create - Forge Frontier&r."
				""
				"From your very first Create machine in the Overworld to the distant worlds beyond the Ad Astra solar system, every factory you've expanded, every planet you've explored, and every challenge you've overcome has been preparing you for this moment."
				""
				"This is not simply another rocket."
				""
				"It is the ultimate expression of your engineering legacy."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lThe Greatest Engineering Project&r"
				""
				"Constructing the Forge Rocket requires the combined knowledge, resources, and technologies gathered from every stage of your adventure."
				""
				"Its components demand materials harvested from the Overworld, the Nether, the End, the Ad Astra planets, and every one of the &bAlex's Caves&r worlds. Advanced automation, complex manufacturing chains, and an industrial infrastructure capable of producing thousands of components all come together to make this extraordinary spacecraft a reality."
				""
				"Only the most accomplished engineers will possess the factory needed to build it."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lA Journey Across Every World&r"
				""
				"The Forge Rocket is more than a collection of advanced parts."
				""
				"It represents every structure you've conquered, every boss you've defeated, every resource you've automated, and every frontier you've explored."
				""
				"From awakening the End Portal and conquering the Ender Dragon to battling legendary creatures across distant alien worlds, every milestone has contributed another piece to your final creation."
				""
				"No adventure..."
				""
				"No matter how small..."
				""
				"Was ever wasted."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lYour Legacy Among the Stars&r"
				""
				"The completion of the Forge Rocket marks the end of one incredible journey and the beginning of another."
				""
				"What started as a modest workshop has become a sprawling interplanetary industrial empire spanning countless worlds. Through determination, creativity, and engineering excellence, you've transformed raw resources into the greatest technological achievement humanity has ever known."
				""
				"Few will ever reach this point."
				""
				"Fewer still will truly appreciate everything it took to get here."
				""
				"Congratulations, Engineer."
				""
				"You've forged your legacy among the stars."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/forge_rocket.png width:130 height:190 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about the Forge Rocket in its"
				"{ \"text\": \"dedicated quest.\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"262FF2B00E853521\" } }"
			]
			id: "7F95771279F2C700"
			rewards: [{
				id: "5A5417D1E23C6582"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 100
			}]
			subtitle: "Assemble the ultimate rocket and advance toward late-game exploration. Click for more info!"
			tasks: [{
				id: "3F4794BFDCC200A7"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					id: "ad_astra_rocketed:tier_7_rocket"
					tag: { }
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&6Forging the Final Frontier&r"
			x: 7.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"&7Welcome to &6Create - Forge Frontier&r, a world where exploration, automation, and engineering go hand in hand."
				""
				"Every machine you construct, every resource you automate, and every world you discover serves a greater purpose. What begins as a small workshop in the Overworld will eventually grow into an industrial empire capable of spanning planets and reshaping entire worlds."
				""
				"This is more than a survival adventure."
				""
				"It is the story of humanity's greatest engineering achievement."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lA World Waiting to Be Explored&r"
				""
				"Your adventure begins in the &aOverworld&r, a land transformed with breathtaking landscapes, forgotten civilizations, dangerous dungeons, and countless secrets waiting to be uncovered."
				""
				"As your factory grows, so too will your ambitions. Ancient relics, powerful bosses, and hidden resources will gradually unlock new technologies and dimensions, each presenting fresh opportunities for expansion."
				""
				"Every discovery becomes another stepping stone toward something far greater."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lBuilding the Future&r"
				""
				"Automation lies at the heart of &6Create - Forge Frontier&r."
				""
				"Throughout your journey, you'll transform simple hand-crafted machines into sprawling industrial complexes capable of processing thousands of resources with ease. From Create contraptions and advanced metallurgy to powerful storage systems and automated production lines, your factory will continuously evolve alongside your technological progress."
				""
				"The larger your factory becomes..."
				""
				"The further your journey can take you."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lReaching Beyond the Overworld&r"
				""
				"As your engineering expertise grows, so too does humanity's reach into the stars."
				""
				"Construct your first &fTier 1 Rocket&r and begin exploring the worlds of &6Ad Astra&r. From the desolate surface of the Moon to the frozen wilderness of Glacio, each planet introduces unique environments, powerful bosses, valuable resources, and entirely new production challenges."
				""
				"The farther you travel from home, the greater both the rewards and the dangers become."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lA Journey Through Every Dimension&r"
				""
				"Your adventure extends far beyond the solar system."
				""
				"The path to &5The End&r has been completely reimagined through &5End Remastered&r, requiring exploration, boss battles, and progression across multiple dimensions before the End Portal can finally be activated."
				""
				"Even after defeating the Ender Dragon, your journey is only beginning. Six extraordinary planets inspired by the biomes of &bAlex's Caves&r await beyond the familiar stars, each offering unique mechanics, powerful creatures, hidden structures, and resources unlike anything encountered before."
				""
				"There is always another horizon waiting to be explored."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lThe Final Frontier&r"
				""
				"Every machine you've built, every world you've explored, and every challenge you've overcome has been preparing you for one final objective."
				""
				"The legendary &6Forge Rocket&r represents the culmination of your entire adventure. Constructing it will require knowledge gathered from every planet, mastery of countless automation systems, and resources collected from every stage of progression."
				""
				"Only those who truly master engineering, exploration, and innovation will possess the skill to complete humanity's greatest creation."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&nYour journey begins now.&r"
				""
				"Build your factory."
				""
				"Explore the unknown."
				""
				"Conquer distant worlds."
				""
				"Master the impossible."
				""
				"And engineer tomorrow's frontier, one creative block at a time."
			]
