		{
			dependencies: ["5EDC9934E7D346D8"]
			description: [
				"The &cNether&r is no longer a destination you can reach on your very first day."
				""
				"In &cNether Remastered&r, entry into this hostile dimension has become a true milestone in your adventure. Before you can ignite a portal, you must first venture across the &aOverworld&r, exploring ancient structures, uncovering forgotten relics, and gathering the components needed to break the barrier between worlds."
				""
				"The road to the Nether begins long before the portal is lit."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Throughout your exploration, you'll discover valuable resources, hidden treasures, and the materials required to craft the &eSeal of the Underworld&r."
				""
				"This ancient artifact serves as the key to unlocking the Nether, symbolizing your readiness to face the dangers that lie beyond. Every dungeon conquered and every relic recovered brings you one step closer to crossing into one of Minecraft's most unforgiving dimensions."
				""
				"Exploration is the price of admission."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Once the &eSeal of the Underworld&r has been crafted, consume it to permanently remove the dimensional barrier preventing access to the Nether."
				""
				"Only then can you ignite a Nether Portal and begin exploring the dangerous landscapes of &cNether Remastered&r. Powerful resources, deadly structures, formidable enemies, and materials essential for future progression all await those prepared to brave its fiery depths."
				""
				"The flames beyond the portal are no longer a shortcut."
				""
				"They are a reward earned through perseverance."
				""
				"Read more about Nether Remastered in its"
				"{ \"text\": \"dedicated quest.\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"6770F96C1A4490DE\" } }"
			]
			icon: "nether_remastered:seal_of_the_underworld_item"
			id: "391748CCFCB25D1A"
			rewards: [
				{
