		{
			dependencies: ["7F95771279F2C700"]
			description: [
				"&7Beyond the &6Forge Rocket&r lies one final challenge."
				""
				"You have conquered distant planets, defeated legendary bosses, mastered countless automation systems, and constructed the greatest spacecraft humanity has ever known. Yet for those who refuse to stop innovating, one final tier of progression remains: &6Creative Technology&r."
				""
				"These extraordinary creations are not required to complete &6Create - Forge Frontier&r. Instead, they exist as the ultimate test of your factory's capabilities—a challenge reserved for engineers determined to achieve absolute mastery."
				""
				"There is no greater goal."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lThe Birth of Infinite Power&r"
				""
				"Every Creative machine begins with a single, irreplaceable resource: &dCreative Energy Fluid&r."
				""
				"Producing this remarkable fluid demands the ultimate sacrifice. A completed &6Forge Rocket&r must be combined with two specialized late-game fluids, consuming one of the most valuable achievements in the entire pack to create the foundation for unlimited technological power."
				""
				"Each bucket represents an incredible investment of time, resources, and engineering expertise."
				""
				"Only the most advanced factories will sustain production at this scale."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lMastery Through Creation&r"
				""
				"With &dCreative Energy Fluid&r in hand, you may begin constructing the most powerful machines ever conceived."
				""
				"Among these legendary creations are:"
				""
				"- &6Creative Motor&r"
				"- &6Creative Fluid Tank&r"
				"- &6Creative Crate&r"
				"- &6Creative Energy Cell&r"
				"- &6Creative Filling Tank&r"
				"- &6Creative Oxygen Can&r"
				""
				"Each Creative component represents complete mastery over one of the major technologies, production chains, and engineering disciplines you've encountered throughout your adventure."
				""
				"Nothing less than perfection will suffice."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lThe Worldshaper&r"
				""
				"Those who obtain every Creative component unlock the final reward of &6Create - Forge Frontier&r:"
				""
				"&eThe Creative Worldshaper&r."
				""
				"More than a tool, the Worldshaper is the ultimate symbol of your journey. It represents complete mastery of automation, exploration, engineering, resource management, and innovation—a testament to every challenge you've overcome and every world you've transformed."
				""
				"Few engineers will ever possess its power."
				""
				"Fewer still will truly understand what it took to earn it."
				""
				"Congratulations."
				""
				"You haven't simply completed &6Create - Forge Frontier&r—"
				""
				"You've mastered it."
			]
